{"title":"모자이크 롤 (Reloaded)","artist":"DECO*27","sourceId":"reference:DUQRDekJJyAroH81p4px","sourceHash":"50169b893a9042422f7ed3dc97a7f775c5889528c829ded9c9a10cf44bfc0451","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":21.1,"end":24.1,"text":"とある言葉がきみに突き刺さり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":26.93,"end":29.93,"text":"傷口から漏れ出す液を\"愛\"と形容してみた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":39.84,"end":42.84,"text":"思いやりの欠如と形だけの交尾は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":46.44,"end":49.44,"text":"腐れ縁のきみとあたしによく似ている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":52.75,"end":55.75,"text":"それでも「好き」とか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":56.81,"end":59.81,"text":"愛したっていいじゃないか 縛り 誰も触れないよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":63.46,"end":66.46000000000001,"text":"これも運命じゃないか 消える消える とある愛世","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":76.08,"end":79.08,"text":"終わる頃にはきみに飽いてるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":81.96000000000001,"end":84.96000000000001,"text":"愛か欲か分からず放つことは何としようか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":88.6,"end":91.6,"text":"きみがくれた涙はあたしが飲み干すから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":94.97,"end":97.97,"text":"「弱虫でもいい」と甘い嘘をくれたら 逃げ出せたのかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":118.55,"end":121.55,"text":"「愛した」って言うのですか？しがみついて藻掻くことを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":124.98,"end":127.98,"text":"殺したっていいじゃないか きみが嫌うあたしなんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":131.54,"end":134.54,"text":"愛したっていいじゃないか 縛り 誰も触れないよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":137.82999999999998,"end":140.82999999999998,"text":"これも運命じゃないか 消える消える とある愛世","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}